  "description": "LAMLIY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Ho4 O22 U2. From the CIF bond table, Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho7 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho8 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 0.701-5.111 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 11.71-156.69°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Ho4O22U2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
